    "detailed_description": "<h1>Path Note</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0.97 updated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t1. Join the new Arcade Mode, abandon distractions, and enjoy the chaotic world of challenges. Challenge the speed limit! Now we are also a racing game~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. More levels will be updated for the Arcade Mode in the future, so stay tuned!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/d211212ea6de71f3f040c6737f377a75.avif?t=1741577901\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must have played many ball-rolling games, but I bet you've never rolled two balls at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that requires coordination, but it's your left and right hands working together\u2014just like Zhou Botong's(One of the top kongfu master in Jin Yong's martial arts novels) legendary skill, the &quot;\u5de6\u53f3\u4e92\u640f&quot; (Mutual Combat of Left and Right). How about giving it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.poster.avif?t=1741577901\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.webm?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.mp4?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/679ce10e845756bb5767ca79c8f2f655.avif?t=1741577901\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your instincts, endure the trials, and press onward with unwavering resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And perhaps, maybe... it's not as straightforward as it seems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to explore the world of DBall~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.poster.avif?t=1741577901\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.webm?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.mp4?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you still want something more ? Who knows.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/d211212ea6de71f3f040c6737f377a75.avif?t=1741577901\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must have played many ball-rolling games, but I bet you've never rolled two balls at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that requires coordination, but it's your left and right hands working together\u2014just like Zhou Botong's(One of the top kongfu master in Jin Yong's martial arts novels) legendary skill, the &quot;\u5de6\u53f3\u4e92\u640f&quot; (Mutual Combat of Left and Right). How about giving it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.poster.avif?t=1741577901\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.webm?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/60b2450722742982d9dfd5e9d16322ec.mp4?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/679ce10e845756bb5767ca79c8f2f655.avif?t=1741577901\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your instincts, endure the trials, and press onward with unwavering resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And perhaps, maybe... it's not as straightforward as it seems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to explore the world of DBall~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.poster.avif?t=1741577901\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.webm?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ed41cd4d563f8508a81437a8d5e69cd9.mp4?t=1741577901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you still want something more ? Who knows.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Dual Ball Challenge: A Clash of Coordination. May the dance of your fingertips guide you forward on this uncharted path. This is a game genre that has never been seen before, and it will undoubtedly take you on a singularly unique journey unlike anything you've ever experienced!",
